WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.090 line:0
Horizontal limestone layers accumulate beneath water.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.240 line:0
Compression then folds the existing beds.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:15.660 line:0
Erosion cuts across those folded layers, removing rock and

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:16.520 line:0
leaving a new surface.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.180 line:0
Younger conglomerate buries that surface.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:30.180 line:0
The angular unconformity records a sequence: deposition, deformation, erosion,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.460 line:0
and renewed deposition.
